Baseline expectation, not an execution claim: while the original scheduled
mapper is held behind the explicit barrier, neither old per-mapper try(response)
can close the delivered response; the paused-close assertion must fail for
COPY and EDIT. The fixed usingWhen owner must close before barrier release.
